Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), curl
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/pedalboard/pedalboard-os

Package: pedalboard-os
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 jackd2,
 adduser,
 systemd
Recommends: mod-host
Description: Pedalboard OS — systemd services, config and bridge for CM5
 Installs and manages all systemd units, systemd targets, udev rules,
 runtime configuration, and the pedalboard-bridge binary for the
 pedalboard audio system running on a Compute Module 5.
 .
 Includes gig mode (pedalboard-gig.target) and studio mode
 (pedalboard-dev.target) for switching between minimal audio-only
 and full development stack at runtime.
